	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Die Veneris praeterita cum non essent ulli <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>cives <placeName ref="l98">Curienses</placeName> in foro, fasciculum tradidi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><persName ref="p4063">Zieglero Ioanni</persName>, <foreign xml:lang="de">der wol <persName>Junghans</persName> heyst, aber der <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>vatter und allt ist; dann es ist noch ein <persName>Hans Ziegler sun</persName>.</foreign></s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Ille sancte promisit se fideliter cum mercibus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><foreign xml:lang="de">(mitt den kouffmans gütern) zuͦ fertigen.</foreign></s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ille hac de re loquerer, advenit <persName>Spönly</persName>, civis noster, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fidelis, qui etiam suam operam promittebat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Itaque fas<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ciculum literarum ad te illis credidi; nam festinavi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName>Curtius</persName> autem profectus erat <placeName ref="l28">Basilaeam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hodie <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>rediit; per quem has mitto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Vestrae omnes mihi <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sunt redditae literae; este ergo animo tranquillo.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Utinam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et meae nunc quoque sint vobis redditae, quod spero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Heri <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>in senatu de rebus praesentibus consultatum est; hodie abe<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>unt cursores <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> etc.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Audio per<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>scribi postulata legatorum<note type="margin">dazu a.R. von Fabr. d. Notiz: "Loquitur de postulatis legatorum <persName>Philippi</persName> et pontificis."</note> ad Urbes etc., vocari item <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>eos ad comitia <placeName>Hęremitana</placeName>, in quibus licet soli <placeName ref="l2448">Qu<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>inquepagici</placeName> et <placeName ref="l646">Claronenses</placeName> sint conventuri, vi<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>detur tamen nostris utile, si aliorum sequestrium legati <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>eo mittantur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quod si non videatur aliis necessarium, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ut eo mittantur legati, puto nostros nihilominus mis<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>suros.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">De legatis ad vestra comitia mittendis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>non intelligo quicquam esse conclusum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Expectabunt <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>aliarum urbium evangelicarum sententiam; ego privatim <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>et publice urgeo, ne quid negligent; sed quid pr<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>oficiam, declarabit eventus.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName> heri <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>sub vesperam scribitur ad me ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> nunciari <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>res feliciter habere in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> et procedere evan<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>gelium; convenisse 4 regni status, tres velle <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>omnino haberi colloquium, quartum, clerum inquam, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>reniti et affirmare extra concilium non licere <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>colloqui etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><persName>Ducem Sabaudiae</persName> instituisse inquisitionem <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>maxime contra nobiles in religione; officiales <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>respondisse, si instituant, imminere mortem <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>eis.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Iccirco quiescit iam caussa illa.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Additur legatum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>pontificis serio agere; sed existimari ipsum effecturum nihil etc.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Haec <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ex <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName> 17. septembris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Audimus ex <placeName ref="l257">Constantia</placeName> <placeName>Emserum</placeName><note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">Markus Sittich von Hohen Emps.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>petere episcopatum et habere bullas pontificis.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Ven<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>isse eo <persName>Bolvylerum</persName> ac omnes putare <placeName>Emserum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>fore episcopum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Cives trepidant pii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Audimus le<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>gatos, qui apud vos fuere, etiam profectos <placeName ref="l291">Lin<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>daviam</placeName>, unde forte ibunt <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName>, ubi inter<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>sint in futationi, <foreign xml:lang="de">frylich einer fulen sach.</foreign></s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Plura <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>non possum undique me urgentibus, ut scribam literas; <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>habeo enim, qui in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> profecturi sunt et... <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>alia.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale itaque cum tuis omnibus, et oremus dominum, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ut nos a malo protegat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">Min herren <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>wüstend gern, was zuͦ antwort uff und vor <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>den gmeinden fiele, und ob ir achtetind, das die <placeName ref="l2448">5 <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Ort</placeName> ouch wurdint botten schicken.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Darumb möcht.<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>.. der h[err] <persName ref="p3196">Tscharner</persName> selbs den herren burgermeistern schryben, ob <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>er wil, wie es sich anlasse vor den gmeinden, mögend ir mir schryben.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 21. s<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>eptembris 1561.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de">In yl.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="de">Der üwer <persName ref="p495">B[ullinger]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae ministro, domino colendo et <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>fratri charissimo suo.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
